# Trivy accepted-risk suppressions for the Quac workspace.
#
# Every entry is a deliberate, reviewed exception; each carries an inline
# `#trivy:ignore` comment with rationale at the offending site.

# terraform/main.tf — Quac is a *public* MaaS API: the internet-facing ALB is
# the product surface, fronted by ACM + an ALB TLS 1.3 security policy.
AWS-0053

# terraform/main.tf — egress is narrowed to tcp/443 only; 0.0.0.0/0 as
# destination is required because Fargate tasks reach DynamoDB/SQS/KMS/
# CloudWatch through a NAT gateway (no VPC interface endpoints in this
# workspace).
AWS-0104

# worker/Dockerfile.worker — AWS Lambda executes container images as root by
# platform design (RIC entrypoint); isolation is the Firecracker microVM plus
# the execution role. The Fargate API image runs non-root (uid 10001).
DS-0002
